      "(SOURCE_PRIMARY_REJECTED → SOURCE_EXPLICIT_REPLACEMENT). P02 is the originally planned article.",185,3),size=8.2,color=INK2,linespacing=1.3)
    fig_footer(fig,k,"Attribution: articles © their authors, licensed CC BY 4.0 (creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Excerpts were used unmodified as cartridge text. Authors/DOI: read now from the article XML.")
    return save_fig(fig,k,"THREE_VERIFIED_PUBLICATIONS","SOURCE VERIFIED",["730.log SOURCE_LOCK / SOURCE_PRIMARY_REJECTED / SOURCE_EXPLICIT_REPLACEMENT / NONEMPTY_BODY_* / PHYSICAL_COMMIT","LIVE_MEASUREMENTS.json sources (Europe PMC re-read)"])

